'''Temptation's Rhapsody''' (絶・誘惑のシンフォニー, ''Zetsu・Yūwaku no Shinfonī'', '''Absolute - Temptation's Symphony''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] and appears on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''', and '''24th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Pied Piper Cat]] - Brass Cat.

